From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 11:10:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] HexaTech CRM sold on its own: product crm_chat and its 30
 module plans

The owner (2026-11-07) asked for the AI chat widget and the CRM as one
workspace, sold on its own as a module. Migration
2026_11_07_120000_add_crm_packages adds the product crm_chat (never the
full suite's crm or chat, which make a full customer in the loyalty
application) and 30 hidden, unpriced plans: crm_lite, crm, crm_pro at
49 / 85 / 149 EUR a month, and CRM with Appointments, Loyalty or Content
in every pair of packages at the sum of the two, 15 % less a month paid
yearly, a 7-day trial. Every package has chatbot and engagement; the
monthly AI allowance is 10 / 25 / 60 USD and adds up with Content's in a
pair. A sold plan is left as it is; a hidden one under the same slug
keeps only these products.

Sell them with: php artisan stripe:sync --module-plans --publish

ModulePlansTest (PostgreSQL): 66 module plans, CRM's prices, products,
names and features, the stray-product clean-up; 9 passed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AxwcUsuzN2nv3iPqShomKA
